# DIT-OS testing

Before editing matching files, read `.agents/skills/testing/SKILL.md` and follow
it. Also apply `AGENTS.md` (definition of done, handoff, hard rules) and the
mandatory `.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md` for every code change.
Content lives in the skill; this file only points to it.

Never forget:
- Agents use scripts/qemu-test.sh, not the interactive make -C bootloader run.
- Anchor qemu-test patterns with ^; no fixed sleeps.
- Never weaken or delete a test to make a change pass.
